  ('702ad5b7-8d51-4005-a0e8-72e85cc12320', 'cybercity-stone-ridge', 'Cybercity Stone Ridge', 'Cybercity Builders & Developers Pvt. Ltd.', 'Moosapet', 'Hyderabad', '2, 3 & 4 BHK Luxury High-Rise Residences (1,300 - 3,805 Sq.Ft.)', ARRAY[2,3,4]::int[], 'Apartment', '₹1.08 Cr – ₹3.45 Cr', 10800000, 34500000, 'Under Construction', '2030-09', '12.33 Acres · 6 Towers (25 & 27 Floors) · Designed by Hafeez Contractor · 66,000 Sft Clubhouse · 70%+ Open Spaces · Vehicle-Free Podium Deck', 'Cybercity Stone Ridge is an under-construction luxury high-rise gated community developed by Cybercity Builders & Developers Pvt. Ltd. on Green Hills Road in Moosapet, near HITEC City, Hyderabad. Spread across 12.33 acres, the project features 6 residential towers rising up to 25 and 27 floors, housing 1,424 spacious 2, 3, and 4 BHK apartments with possession scheduled for 2030. Conceived by master architect Hafeez Contractor with landscaping by CPG Asia, it dedicates over 70% of its footprint to open spaces and a vehicle-free podium deck.', ARRAY['Club Stone Ridge – 66,000 Sq.Ft. 6-Level Clubhouse','Vehicle-Free Ground-Level Podium Deck','1.5-Acre Central Park & Manicured Gardens','1.2-Acre Rock Adventure Zone with Boulders Trail','50-Meter Olympic-Size Lap Pool & Splash Pools','Eight Themed Gardens & Outdoor Hammock Lawns','Indoor Squash & Wooden Badminton Courts','Floodlit Synthetic Tennis & Pickleball Courts','Full Basketball Court & Sand Volleyball Arena','Cricket Practice Batting Nets & Skate Park','Co-Working Workstation Suites & Private Pods','On-Site Supermarket, Pharmacy & Daycare/Crèche','Dedicated Fenced Pet Park with Agility Lawns','Solar-Powered Entrance & Rainwater Harvesting Pits','24/7 Smart Security with Automated RFID Access']::text[], '[{"q":"What is Cybercity Stone Ridge and who is the developer?","a":"Cybercity Stone Ridge is an under-construction luxury high-rise gated community developed by Cybercity Builders & Developers Pvt. Ltd. on Green Hills Road in Moosapet, near HITEC City, Hyderabad. Spanning 12.33 acres, it features 6 residential towers (25 and 27 floors) with 1,424 apartments."},{"q":"Who designed Cybercity Stone Ridge?","a":"The project is designed by renowned architect Hafeez Contractor with landscape architecture curated by international landscape consultancy CPG Asia."},{"q":"Is Cybercity Stone Ridge TG RERA registered?","a":"Yes, registered with Telangana RERA under registration numbers TG RERA P02200009747 and P02200009748."},{"q":"What is the expected possession timeline?","a":"The project was launched in 2025 and targets handover between May 2030 and September 2030."},{"q":"What configurations and sizes are available?","a":"Stone Ridge offers 2 BHK (~1,300 sq.ft.), 3 BHK (1,650 – 2,760 sq.ft.), and 4 BHK (3,170 – 3,805 sq.ft.) luxury residences with Vastu-compliant layouts."},{"q":"What is the price range and base per sq. ft. rate?","a":"Base prices range between ₹8,300 and ₹9,100 per sq. ft. Unit values track from ₹1.08 Cr – ₹1.21 Cr for 2 BHK, ₹1.60 Cr – ₹2.50 Cr for 3 BHK, and ₹2.73 Cr – ₹3.45 Cr for 4 BHK, subject to floor rise, PLC, and statutory charges."},{"q":"What lifestyle amenities are included?","a":"Amenities are anchored by Club Stone Ridge (66,000 sq.ft. across 6 levels) including spa/salon, gym, yoga studios, badminton, squash, co-working lounges, guest rooms, and a rooftop deck, alongside a 1.5-acre Central Park, a 1.2-acre Rock Adventure Zone, and 70+ sports amenities."}]'::jsonb, ARRAY['/og-cybercity-stone-ridge.jpg']::text[], '/og-cybercity-stone-ridge.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps?q=Cybercity+Stone+Ridge+Moosapet+Hyderabad&output=embed', 'Cybercity Stone Ridge Moosapet Hyderabad | Luxury 2, 3 & 4 BHK Apartments', 'Cybercity Stone Ridge on Green Hills Road, Moosapet, near HITEC City, Hyderabad. 12.33 acres, 6 towers (25-27 floors), 66,000 sft clubhouse, 70%+ open spaces by Hafeez Contractor. Get pricing & floor plans.', 'https://www.naani.in/projects/cybercity-stone-ridge', '/projects/cybercity-stone-ridge', true, 'published', NULL, '2026-05-07T06:55:25.521361+00:00', 'internal', '2026-05-07T06:55:25.521361+00:00', '2026-11-21T11:12:35.469Z'),
